<title>INDONESIA: Matahari Q1 net up to 41.3 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Matahari Q1 net up to 41.3 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>				   (in billion rupiah)</p>
<p>    Net income			41.3  vs  21.8</p>
<p>    Revenue			  580.9  vs 542.6</p>
<p>    Operating profit		64.6  vs  44.0</p>
<p>NOTE: The results were unaudited. PT Matahari Putra Prima is among Indonesia's largest retailers.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
